a filifolia\"></a>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"24654":{"t":"品種之一","pub":"2011-06-14","upd":"","body":"<a href=\"https://kmweb.moa.gov.tw/files/IMITA_Gallery/78/7386c10fba_m.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img data-p=\"e5a1094ab5ad\" alt=\"品種之一\"></a>leiboldiana<br>\n中型種類","gallery":[],"files":[]},"24653":{"t":"鐵蘭屬","pub":"2009-03-30","upd":"","body":"<a href=\"https://kmweb.moa.gov.tw/files/IMITA_Gallery/78/fb499f7527_m.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img data-p=\"9d5d0fd2bff0\" alt=\"鐵蘭屬\"></a>(Tillandsia)又名木柄鳳梨屬、空氣鳳梨屬。  本屬原產於熱帶美州、及亞熱帶地區。約有500多個原生種。為鳳梨科中最大的ㄧ屬。<br>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"43264":{"t":"銀白小鳳梨 Cryptanthus acaulis var. argenteus","pub":"2021-03-08","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"5566d88f379f\" alt=\"銀白小鳳梨_Cryptanthus_acaulis_var__argenteus_(攝於科博館)--01\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"43263":{"t":"福氏小鳳梨 Cryptanthus fosteranus","pub":"2021-03-08","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"50fb04664cfc\" alt=\"福氏小鳳梨_Cryptanthus_fosteranus_(攝於科博館)\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"43262":{"t":"絨葉小鳳梨","pub":"2021-03-08","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"52a47ef38768\" alt=\"絨葉小鳳梨\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"41609":{"t":"絨葉小鳳梨 Cryptanthus bivittatus","pub":"2020-06-15","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"d3eb6d72fd16\" alt=\"絨葉小鳳梨_Cryptanthus_bivittatus_(攝於科博館)--02\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"41608":{"t":"絨葉小鳳梨 Cryptanthus bivittatus Minor","pub":"2020-06-15","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"b5fd609311c4\" alt=\"絨葉小鳳梨_Cryptanthus_bivittatus_Minor_(攝於科博館)\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"41007":{"t":"紅葉小鳳梨 Cryptanthus acaulis var. ruber","pub":"2020-03-23","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"c9241801e3bf\" alt=\"紅葉小鳳梨_Cryptanthus_acaulis_var__ruber_(攝於科博館)\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"41006":{"t":"虎紋小鳳梨 Cryptanthus zonatus","pub":"2020-03-23","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"553bfb035e78\" alt=\"虎紋小鳳梨_Cryptanthus_zonatus_(攝於科博館)\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"41005":{"t":"小鳳梨 Cryptanthus 'Cafe Au Lait'","pub":"2020-03-23","upd":"2020-06-15","body":"<p><img data-p=\"3c79b7dcf925\" alt=\"小鳳梨_Cryptanthus_&#x27;Cafe_Au_Lait&#x27;_(攝於科博館)--02\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"46132":{"t":"厚葉鳳梨屬觀賞鳳梨 Dyckia-02","pub":"2022-03-08","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"54531a1761ad\" alt=\"厚葉鳳梨屬觀賞鳳梨_Dyckia-02\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"46131":{"t":"厚葉鳳梨屬觀賞鳳梨 Dyckia-01","pub":"2022-03-08","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"a6a74788705a\" alt=\"厚葉鳳梨屬觀賞鳳梨_Dyckia-01\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"45406":{"t":"硬葉鳳梨屬觀賞鳳梨 Dyckia forteriana","pub":"2021-12-20","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"2ab724ca44d7\" alt=\"硬葉鳳梨屬觀賞鳳梨_Dyckia_forteriana_(攝於科博館)\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"45405":{"t":"無刺厚葉鳳梨 Dyckia 'Naked Lady'","pub":"2021-12-20","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"d4f54613074e\" alt=\"無刺厚葉鳳梨_Dyckia_&#x27;Naked_Lady&#x27;_(攝於科博館)\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"44493":{"t":"厚葉鳳梨Dyckia brevifolia-03","pub":"2021-09-27","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"620390f6dd97\" alt=\"厚葉鳳梨Dyckia_brevifolia-03\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"44492":{"t":"厚葉鳳梨Dyckia brevifolia-02","pub":"2021-09-27","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"1fb11b7f2c18\" alt=\"厚葉鳳梨Dyckia_brevifolia-02\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"44491":{"t":"厚葉鳳梨Dyckia brevifolia-01","pub":"2021-09-27","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"bf614fb9374d\" alt=\"厚葉鳳梨Dyckia_brevifolia-01\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"49479":{"t":"波蒂亞鳳梨 Portea petropolitana","pub":"2022-12-22","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"960724945f68\" alt=\"波蒂亞鳳梨_Portea_petropolitana_(攝於科博館)--02\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"49478":{"t":"波蒂亞鳳梨 Portea petropolitana","pub":"2022-12-22","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"6415d329ecb7\" alt=\"波蒂亞鳳梨_Portea_petropolitana_(攝於科博館)--01\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"52646":{"t":"紅岩莪蘿鳳梨 Orthophytum saxicola Rubrum","pub":"2023-09-19","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"3f92eed2710b\" alt=\"紅岩莪蘿鳳梨_Orthophytum_saxicola_Rubrum_(攝於科博館)\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"50398":{"t":"莪蘿屬鳳梨 Orthophytum foliosum -03","pub":"2023-03-08","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"a60601185038\" alt=\"莪蘿屬觀賞鳳梨_Orthophytum_foliosum_-03\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"50397":{"t":"莪蘿屬鳳梨 Orthophytum foliosum -02","pub":"2023-03-08","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"2c27db41b38c\" alt=\"莪蘿屬觀賞鳳梨_Orthophytum_foliosum_-02\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"50396":{"t":"莪蘿屬鳳梨 Orthophytum foliosum -01","pub":"2023-03-08","upd":"","body":"<p><img data-p=\"9b3c9b15dfb3\" alt=\"莪蘿屬觀賞鳳梨_Orthophytum_foliosum_-01\"></p>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"24602":{"t":"如何選購觀賞鳳梨","pub":"2009-03-05","upd":"","body":"<a href=\"https://kmweb.moa.gov.tw/files/IMITA_Gallery/78/2100bb22d3_m.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img data-p=\"33bfb0d1b55c\" alt=\"如何選購觀賞鳳梨\"></a>介紹了種類豐富外觀多樣美麗的觀賞鳳梨，及其利用的方式。消費者該如何選購觀賞鳳梨盆栽呢？首先觀察盆栽整體表現，植株青翠有活力，葉片完整無破損，葉尖不枯焦，葉形不宜太直立，線條柔和，葉色全綠。花穗長度夠，形態自然不緊縮，苞片顏色轉色完全且完整，色澤鮮艷。植株的高度，以大型擎天類如Ostara品種，從盆面到花穗頂端大於55公分，此外還要配合整體株型的表現，如葉片寬幅與植株高度的比例，花穗長度與株高的比例；而中擎從盆面到花穗頂端大於35公分；小擎從盆面到花穗頂端大於15公分。觀賞鳳梨的盆花壽命在室內可達2-3個月，通常在室內放在空氣流通，光線適宜的環境下，所以可放在靠近窗戶旁，陽光不會直接照射的位置。不需常常澆水，一般用手觸摸栽培介質，感覺乾燥時再行澆水，澆水時將介質澆透，讓水從盆栽底部流出，亦可澆水在觀賞鳳梨的葉片心部，如此即可完成觀賞鳳梨居家管理。","gallery":[],"files":[]},"24652":{"t":"金鑽擎天鳳梨Guzmania 'Symphonie'","pub":"2018-06-14","upd":"","body":"<a href=\"https://kmweb.moa.gov.tw/files/IMITA_Gallery/78/48bbd30aed_m.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img data-p=\"beb01012f712\" alt=\"金鑽擎天鳳梨Guzmania &#x27;Symphonie&#x27;\"></a>攝於科博館","gallery":[],"files":[]},"24651":{"t":"銀葉鳳梨屬觀賞鳳梨 (Hechtia glauca)","pub":"2017-12-23","upd":"","body":"<a href=\"https://kmweb.moa.gov.tw/files/IMITA_Gallery/78/8c4635ddb2_m.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img data-p=\"487072857252\" alt=\"銀葉鳳梨屬觀賞鳳梨 (Hechtia glauca)\"></a>","gallery":[],"files":[]},"24650":{"t":"銀白硬葉鳳梨 (Dyckia marnier-lapostollei)","pub":"2017-12-23","upd":"","body":"<a href=\"https://kmweb.moa.gov.tw/files/IMITA_Gallery/78/5c57145fb8_m.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img data-p=\"1e4c33fe75c8\" alt=\"銀白硬葉鳳梨 (Dyckia marnier-lapostollei)\"></a>","gallery